select ew_private.seed_lessons($ew$[{"id":"1501ea07-63d8-b7cb-fd4c-7769f482dde9","slug":"safety-basics","sort_order":1,"difficulty":1,"est_minutes":10,"icon":"shield","t":{"uz":{"title":"Xavfsizlik asoslari","summary":"Har qanday elektr ishidan oldin bilishingiz shart bo'lgan qoidalar."},"ru":{"title":"Основы безопасности","summary":"Правила, которые нужно знать перед любой электрической работой."},"en":{"title":"Safety basics","summary":"Rules you must know before any electrical work."}},"steps":[{"id":"4eb5cec8-55c8-86d4-793f-20c5e30cbe7c","sort_order":0,"illustration":"breaker_off","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Elektr toki ko'rinmaydi va hidi yo'q. 220 V kuchlanish o'ldirishi mumkin. Shuning uchun hech qachon kuchlanish ostidagi simlar bilan ishlamang.","warning":"Kuchlanish ostida ishlash taqiqlanadi."},"ru":{"text":"Электрический ток невидим и не имеет запаха. Напряжение 220 В может убить. Поэтому никогда не работайте с проводами под напряжением.","warning":"Работа под напряжением запрещена."},"en":{"text":"Electric current is invisible and has no smell. 220 V can kill. Never work on wires that are live.","warning":"Working on live wires is forbidden."}}},{"id":"dba681c0-9325-845a-11e1-39289a14e7c7","sort_order":1,"illustration":"breaker_off","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Ishni boshlashdan oldin elektr shchitidagi tegishli avtomatni o'chiring. Qaysi avtomat ekanini bilmasangiz, kirish (umumiy) avtomatni o'chiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Перед началом работы выключите соответствующий автомат в электрощите. Если не знаете, какой именно, выключите вводной (общий) автомат.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Before you start, switch off the matching circuit breaker in the panel. If you are not sure which one, switch off the main breaker.","warning":""}}},{"id":"b36caf10-a6cb-4d1f-7da3-edc3f83bf31f","sort_order":2,"illustration":"warning_sign","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Shchitga \"Yoqmang! Odamlar ishlayapti\" degan yozuv iling va oiladagilarni ogohlantiring. Imkon bo'lsa, shchitni qulflang.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Повесьте на щит табличку «Не включать! Работают люди» и предупредите домашних. Если возможно, заприте щит.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Hang a \"Do not switch on! Work in progress\" sign on the panel and tell everyone at home. Lock the panel if you can.","warning":""}}},{"id":"ad66d191-1d1c-ee0b-f27c-5e9a4a8575ca","sort_order":3,"illustration":"voltage_tester","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Indikator yoki tester bilan barcha simlarda kuchlanish yo'qligini tekshiring. Avval testerni ishlayotgan rozetkada sinab ko'ring, keyin ish joyini, so'ng yana ishlayotgan rozetkani.","warning":"Tester ishlamasa — ishni boshlamang."},"ru":{"text":"Индикатором или тестером проверьте отсутствие напряжения на всех проводах. Сначала проверьте тестер на заведомо рабочей розетке, затем место работы, затем снова рабочую розетку.","warning":"Если тестер неисправен — не начинайте работу."},"en":{"text":"Use a voltage indicator or tester to confirm there is no voltage on every wire. Test the tester on a known live socket first, then the work area, then the live socket again.","warning":"If the tester does not work, do not start."}}},{"id":"a3f42b0d-c02a-efc3-7ac2-567fdc0f179b","sort_order":4,"illustration":"tools","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_screwdriver_set","tool_pliers"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Faqat izolyatsiyalangan dastali asboblardan foydalaning (1000 V belgisi bilan). Quruq qo'lda, quruq poyabzalda ishlang, uzuk va soatni yeching.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Используйте только инструмент с изолированными рукоятками (маркировка 1000 В). Работайте сухими руками, в сухой обуви, снимите кольца и часы.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Use only insulated tools (rated 1000 V). Work with dry hands and dry shoes; remove rings and watches.","warning":""}}},{"id":"448cf9b8-b353-b27e-d1eb-c090c882ad81","sort_order":5,"illustration":"wire_colors","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Sim ranglari: jigarrang/qizil/qora — faza (L), ko'k — nol (N), sariq-yashil — himoya yerga ulash (PE). Eski uylarda ranglar boshqacha bo'lishi mumkin — har doim tester bilan tekshiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Цвета проводов: коричневый/красный/чёрный — фаза (L), синий — ноль (N), жёлто-зелёный — защитное заземление (PE). В старых домах цвета могут отличаться — всегда проверяйте тестером.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Wire colours: brown/red/black — phase (L), blue — neutral (N), yellow-green — protective earth (PE). Old houses may differ — always verify with a tester.","warning":""}}},{"id":"d9b513bd-660c-5d23-4551-017f5ef57366","sort_order":6,"illustration":"electrician","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Shchit ichidagi ishlar, yerga ulash tizimi, 3 fazali tarmoq, vannaxona va kuchli qurilmalar (pech, qozon, kuchli konditsioner) — faqat litsenziyali elektrik ishi. Kuyish izi, hid yoki uchqun ko'rsangiz — to'xtang va elektrik chaqiring.","warning":"Shubha bo'lsa — elektrik chaqiring."},"ru":{"text":"Работы в щите, система заземления, 3-фазная сеть, ванная комната и мощные приборы (духовка, бойлер, мощный кондиционер) — только для лицензированного электрика. Если видите следы гари, запах или искры — остановитесь и вызовите электрика.","warning":"Сомневаетесь — вызовите электрика."},"en":{"text":"Panel work, earthing systems, 3-phase supply, bathrooms and high-power appliances (oven, boiler, large AC) are for a licensed electrician only. If you see burn marks, smell burning or see sparks — stop and call an electrician.","warning":"When in doubt, call an electrician."}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"4f2a1347-18f3-664a-edf8-f161c8b3e56f","sort_order":0,"correct_index":1,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Ishni boshlashdan oldin birinchi navbatda nima qilinadi?","options":["Simlarni kesish","Avtomatni o'chirish va kuchlanish yo'qligini tekshirish","Rozetkani yechish"],"explanation":"Avval avtomat o'chiriladi, keyin tester bilan kuchlanish yo'qligi tekshiriladi."},"ru":{"q":"Что делается в первую очередь перед началом работы?","options":["Отрезать провода","Выключить автомат и проверить отсутствие напряжения","Снять розетку"],"explanation":"Сначала выключают автомат, затем тестером проверяют отсутствие напряжения."},"en":{"q":"What do you do first before starting work?","options":["Cut the wires","Switch off the breaker and verify there is no voltage","Remove the socket"],"explanation":"Switch off the breaker first, then verify absence of voltage with a tester."}}},{"id":"e9a2464b-dc6f-57ee-7042-4bfd8a83633f","sort_order":1,"correct_index":2,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Sariq-yashil sim nimani bildiradi?","options":["Faza","Nol","Himoya yerga ulash (PE)"],"explanation":"Sariq-yashil rang faqat himoya yerga ulash o'tkazgichi uchun ishlatiladi."},"ru":{"q":"Что означает жёлто-зелёный провод?","options":["Фаза","Ноль","Защитное заземление (PE)"],"explanation":"Жёлто-зелёный цвет используется только для защитного проводника."},"en":{"q":"What does a yellow-green wire mean?","options":["Phase","Neutral","Protective earth (PE)"],"explanation":"Yellow-green is used only for the protective earth conductor."}}},{"id":"dcb32be6-31e5-854a-615a-dca2fcd59860","sort_order":2,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Rozetka atrofida kuyish izi ko'rdingiz. Nima qilasiz?","options":["Ishni to'xtatib, elektrik chaqiraman","Lenta bilan o'rab qo'yaman","E'tibor bermayman"],"explanation":"Kuyish izi — shikastlangan sim belgisi. Bu DIY ish emas."},"ru":{"q":"Вы увидели следы гари у розетки. Что делать?","options":["Остановить работу и вызвать электрика","Замотать изолентой","Не обращать внимания"],"explanation":"Следы гари — признак повреждённой проводки. Это не работа «своими руками»."},"en":{"q":"You see burn marks around a socket. What do you do?","options":["Stop and call an electrician","Wrap it with tape","Ignore it"],"explanation":"Burn marks indicate damaged wiring. This is not a DIY job."}}}]},{"id":"8c5e6484-66a0-1941-3ab4-3707b36a89a5","slug":"voltage-tester","sort_order":2,"difficulty":1,"est_minutes":10,"icon":"tester","t":{"uz":{"title":"Indikator va multimetrdan foydalanish","summary":"Kuchlanish yo'qligini to'g'ri tekshirishni o'rganing."},"ru":{"title":"Как пользоваться индикатором и мультиметром","summary":"Научитесь правильно проверять отсутствие напряжения."},"en":{"title":"Using a voltage indicator and multimeter","summary":"Learn to verify absence of voltage correctly."}},"steps":[{"id":"acf88d94-004d-b62f-623e-7b08e187b32f","sort_order":0,"illustration":"voltage_tester","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Indikator-otvyortka: uchi bilan simga tegasiz, barmog'ingiz bilan orqa kontaktga tegasiz. Chiroq yonsa — bu faza. Arzon indikatorlar har doim ham ishonchli emas.","warning":"Indikatorning metall uchiga barmoq bilan tegmang."},"ru":{"text":"Индикаторная отвёртка: касаетесь жалом провода, пальцем — контакта на торце. Загорелась лампочка — это фаза. Дешёвые индикаторы не всегда надёжны.","warning":"Не касайтесь пальцами металлического жала."},"en":{"text":"Indicator screwdriver: touch the wire with the tip and the cap contact with your finger. If the lamp lights, it is phase. Cheap indicators are not always reliable.","warning":"Never touch the metal tip with your fingers."}}},{"id":"b10c0821-d8d7-3a6a-23e6-d3f12437b519","sort_order":1,"illustration":"multimeter","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_multimeter"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Multimetr: qora shchupni COM ga, qizilni V ga ulang. O'zgaruvchan kuchlanish rejimini tanlang (V~, 600 V yoki 750 V).","warning":"Hech qachon tok (A) rejimida rozetkaga tiqmang — qisqa tutashuv bo'ladi."},"ru":{"text":"Мультиметр: чёрный щуп — в гнездо COM, красный — в V. Выберите режим переменного напряжения (V~, 600 В или 750 В).","warning":"Никогда не вставляйте щупы в розетку в режиме тока (A) — будет короткое замыкание."},"en":{"text":"Multimeter: black probe in COM, red probe in V. Select AC voltage (V~, 600 V or 750 V range).","warning":"Never put probes into a socket in current (A) mode — it causes a short circuit."}}},{"id":"360c878d-3659-93ce-8e64-95fdb2046513","sort_order":2,"illustration":"multimeter","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_multimeter"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Asbobni sinang: ishlayotgan rozetkada L–N orasida taxminan 220–230 V ko'rinishi kerak.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Проверьте прибор: на рабочей розетке между L и N должно быть примерно 220–230 В.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Prove the tester: on a known live socket you should read about 220–230 V between L and N.","warning":""}}},{"id":"c36d638f-9a2f-74d8-3da7-62243d128227","sort_order":3,"illustration":"breaker_off","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_multimeter"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Avtomatni o'chirgach, ish joyida barcha juftliklarni tekshiring: L–N, L–PE, N–PE. Hammasi 0 V bo'lishi kerak.","warning":"Hatto bitta juftlikda kuchlanish bo'lsa — ishlamang."},"ru":{"text":"После отключения автомата проверьте на месте работы все пары: L–N, L–PE, N–PE. Везде должно быть 0 В.","warning":"Если хотя бы на одной паре есть напряжение — не работайте."},"en":{"text":"After switching off the breaker, test every pair at the work area: L–N, L–PE, N–PE. All must read 0 V.","warning":"If any pair shows voltage — do not work."}}},{"id":"31e6c9e2-d4d3-cf00-6745-bd8cf5643df0","sort_order":4,"illustration":"multimeter","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_multimeter"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Yana ishlayotgan rozetkada asbobni tekshiring. Bu \"yoniq–o'chiq–yoniq\" usuli asbob buzilmaganini tasdiqlaydi.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Снова проверьте прибор на рабочей розетке. Метод «есть–нет–есть» подтверждает, что прибор исправен.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Check the tester again on the live socket. This \"live–dead–live\" method proves the tester did not fail.","warning":""}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"562f224f-35bf-d103-8412-7c9b56cec792","sort_order":0,"correct_index":1,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Multimetr rozetkani o'lchash uchun qaysi rejimda bo'lishi kerak?","options":["Tok (A)","O'zgaruvchan kuchlanish (V~)","Qarshilik (Ω)"],"explanation":"Rozetkada kuchlanish o'lchanadi — V~ rejimi."},"ru":{"q":"В каком режиме должен быть мультиметр для измерения розетки?","options":["Ток (A)","Переменное напряжение (V~)","Сопротивление (Ω)"],"explanation":"В розетке измеряют напряжение — режим V~."},"en":{"q":"Which multimeter mode do you use on a socket?","options":["Current (A)","AC voltage (V~)","Resistance (Ω)"],"explanation":"You measure voltage on a socket — V~ mode."}}},{"id":"1971c3a5-1565-467c-2189-be5e511bbbc7","sort_order":1,"correct_index":2,"t":{"uz":{"q":"\"Yoniq–o'chiq–yoniq\" usuli nima uchun kerak?","options":["Tezroq ishlash uchun","Batareyani tejash uchun","Tester ishlayotganini tasdiqlash uchun"],"explanation":"Tester buzilgan bo'lsa, u 0 V ko'rsatadi va siz adashasiz."},"ru":{"q":"Зачем нужен метод «есть–нет–есть»?","options":["Чтобы работать быстрее","Чтобы сэкономить батарейку","Чтобы подтвердить исправность тестера"],"explanation":"Неисправный тестер покажет 0 В, и вы ошибётесь."},"en":{"q":"Why use the live–dead–live method?","options":["To work faster","To save the battery","To prove the tester works"],"explanation":"A broken tester reads 0 V and misleads you."}}},{"id":"2e42062f-580e-2472-f1f2-0ff9f82a5388","sort_order":2,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Qaysi juftliklarni tekshirish kerak?","options":["L–N, L–PE, N–PE","Faqat L–N","Faqat L–PE"],"explanation":"Barcha juftliklarni tekshirish xavfsizroq."},"ru":{"q":"Какие пары нужно проверить?","options":["L–N, L–PE, N–PE","Только L–N","Только L–PE"],"explanation":"Проверять все пары безопаснее."},"en":{"q":"Which pairs must you test?","options":["L–N, L–PE, N–PE","Only L–N","Only L–PE"],"explanation":"Testing all pairs is the safe way."}}}]},{"id":"7785197d-8805-f736-37f6-2b7dcf628cee","slug":"replace-bulb","sort_order":3,"difficulty":1,"est_minutes":5,"icon":"bulb","t":{"uz":{"title":"Lampochkani almashtirish","summary":"Eng oddiy ish — lekin u ham qoidalar bilan."},"ru":{"title":"Замена лампочки","summary":"Самая простая работа — но тоже по правилам."},"en":{"title":"Replacing a light bulb","summary":"The simplest job — still done by the rules."}},"steps":[{"id":"b33200ef-3c43-e698-7823-9bf1df369677","sort_order":0,"illustration":"switch_off","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Kalitni o'chiring. Patron shikastlangan yoki lampochka sinib qolgan bo'lsa — avtomatni ham o'chiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Выключите выключатель. Если патрон повреждён или лампа разбита — отключите и автомат.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Turn the switch off. If the holder is damaged or the bulb is broken, switch off the breaker too.","warning":""}}},{"id":"2d4f847e-54bd-3eda-4a02-ec51bbbf2de6","sort_order":1,"illustration":"bulb","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Lampochka sovishini 5–10 daqiqa kuting. Barqaror narvon yoki stul ishlating.","warning":"Issiq lampochka qo'lni kuydiradi."},"ru":{"text":"Подождите 5–10 минут, пока лампа остынет. Используйте устойчивую стремянку.","warning":"Горячая лампа обжигает руки."},"en":{"text":"Wait 5–10 minutes for the bulb to cool. Use a stable step ladder.","warning":"A hot bulb burns your hand."}}},{"id":"6590f2f9-b7cf-0948-89b8-07967295a8a5","sort_order":2,"illustration":"bulb","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Eski lampochkani soat miliga teskari burab chiqaring. Yangi lampochkaning tsokoli (E27/E14) va quvvati yoritgich ruxsat etganidan oshmasligini tekshiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Выкрутите старую лампу против часовой стрелки. Проверьте цоколь (E27/E14) новой лампы и что её мощность не выше допустимой для светильника.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Unscrew the old bulb anticlockwise. Check the new bulb's base (E27/E14) and that its wattage does not exceed the fixture's maximum.","warning":""}}},{"id":"49af0194-36ed-ba5a-34a5-d731cf06ecda","sort_order":3,"illustration":"bulb","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Yangi lampochkani soat mili bo'yicha qattiq kuch ishlatmasdan burang. Keyin yoqib tekshiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Вкрутите новую лампу по часовой стрелке без чрезмерного усилия. Затем включите и проверьте.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Screw in the new bulb clockwise without excessive force. Then switch on and test.","warning":""}}},{"id":"3b39ddc1-41d1-03d3-6474-135d119786fa","sort_order":4,"illustration":"electrician","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Lampochkalar tez-tez kuyib qolsa yoki patron qizib ketsa — bu kontakt muammosi. Elektrik ko'rigidan o'tkazing.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Если лампы часто перегорают или патрон греется — это проблема контакта. Обратитесь к электрику.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"If bulbs blow often or the holder gets hot, there is a contact problem. Have an electrician check it.","warning":""}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"f55c674c-d192-3e0a-65ae-1ffbcf4cb0e4","sort_order":0,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Lampochka quvvati qanday bo'lishi kerak?","options":["Yoritgich ruxsat etgan maksimaldan oshmasligi","Iloji boricha katta","Farqi yo'q"],"explanation":"Ortiqcha quvvat patron va simlarni qizdiradi."},"ru":{"q":"Какой должна быть мощность лампы?","options":["Не выше максимума светильника","Как можно больше","Неважно"],"explanation":"Лишняя мощность перегревает патрон и провода."},"en":{"q":"What wattage should the bulb have?","options":["Not above the fixture's maximum","As high as possible","It does not matter"],"explanation":"Excess wattage overheats the holder and wires."}}},{"id":"268e02f9-dd05-e1aa-f3ad-08d2504c3d29","sort_order":1,"correct_index":1,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Lampochka sinib qolgan bo'lsa, nima qilasiz?","options":["Faqat kalitni o'chiraman","Avtomatni ham o'chiraman","Qo'l bilan tortib olaman"],"explanation":"Singan lampochkada metall qismlar ochiq — avtomatni o'chiring."},"ru":{"q":"Лампа разбилась. Что делать?","options":["Только выключить выключатель","Отключить и автомат","Выкрутить руками"],"explanation":"У разбитой лампы открыты металлические части — отключите автомат."},"en":{"q":"The bulb is broken. What do you do?","options":["Only turn the switch off","Switch off the breaker too","Pull it out by hand"],"explanation":"A broken bulb exposes metal parts — switch off the breaker."}}}]},{"id":"cfa27f9e-6a7f-c2fe-4460-2abe0e2a5464","slug":"install-socket","sort_order":4,"difficulty":2,"est_minutes":30,"icon":"socket","t":{"uz":{"title":"Rozetka o'rnatish","summary":"Rozetkani podrozetnikka to'g'ri ulash."},"ru":{"title":"Установка розетки","summary":"Правильное подключение розетки в подрозетник."},"en":{"title":"Installing a socket","summary":"Connecting a socket correctly into a wall box."}},"steps":[{"id":"d8bc76e1-43a5-cf93-1e49-0ace1919d5a4","sort_order":0,"illustration":"breaker_off","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Rozetkalar guruhining avtomatini o'chiring, belgi iling va simlarda kuchlanish yo'qligini tekshiring.","warning":"Kuchlanish yo'qligi tasdiqlanmaguncha simlarga tegmang."},"ru":{"text":"Отключите автомат розеточной группы, повесьте табличку и проверьте отсутствие напряжения на проводах.","warning":"Не трогайте провода, пока не подтвердили отсутствие напряжения."},"en":{"text":"Switch off the socket circuit breaker, hang the sign and verify there is no voltage on the wires.","warning":"Do not touch the wires until absence of voltage is confirmed."}}},{"id":"56942f5a-3178-9e44-f413-97ab50631942","sort_order":1,"illustration":"socket_box","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_wire_stripper"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Podrozetnikdan simlarni chiqaring. 10–15 sm zapas qoldiring. Har bir simning uchidan 10 mm izolyatsiyani tozalang.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Выведите провода из подрозетника, оставив запас 10–15 см. Снимите с конца каждой жилы 10 мм изоляции.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Pull the wires out of the wall box, leaving 10–15 cm of slack. Strip 10 mm of insulation from each conductor.","warning":""}}},{"id":"4e76ab7e-aa25-c02c-b0e8-34285d11182e","sort_order":2,"illustration":"socket_wiring","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_screwdriver_set"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Fazani (jigarrang) va nolni (ko'k) rozetkaning ikkita yon klemmasiga ulang. Vintlarni mahkam torting, mis ochiq qolmasin.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Фазу (коричневый) и ноль (синий) подключите к двум боковым клеммам розетки. Затяните винты, чтобы оголённая медь не торчала.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Connect phase (brown) and neutral (blue) to the two side terminals. Tighten firmly; no bare copper should stick out.","warning":""}}},{"id":"8626b301-8408-cf4b-a3ba-a6fe7e07c8f5","sort_order":3,"illustration":"socket_wiring","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_screwdriver_set"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Sariq-yashil PE simi bo'lsa, uni rozetkaning yerga ulash klemmasiga (o'rtadagi mo'ylovlar) ulang. PE simi yo'q bo'lsa, yerga ulash klemmasini nolga ULAMANG.","warning":"Yerga ulash klemmasini nol bilan tutashtirish xavfli."},"ru":{"text":"Если есть жёлто-зелёный провод PE, подключите его к клемме заземления (средние усики). Если PE нет — НЕ соединяйте клемму заземления с нулём.","warning":"Соединять клемму заземления с нулём опасно."},"en":{"text":"If there is a yellow-green PE wire, connect it to the earth terminal (the centre clips). If there is no PE, do NOT connect the earth terminal to neutral.","warning":"Bridging earth to neutral is dangerous."}}},{"id":"5875062a-67fd-b118-559b-569064bc0988","sort_order":4,"illustration":"socket_box","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_screwdriver_set"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Simlarni ehtiyotkorlik bilan podrozetnikka joylang. Mexanizmni tekis qo'yib, vintlar bilan mahkamlang, keyin ramka va qopqoqni o'rnating.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Аккуратно уложите провода в подрозетник. Установите механизм ровно, закрепите винтами, затем рамку и крышку.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Fold the wires neatly into the box. Set the mechanism level, fix it with the screws, then fit the frame and cover.","warning":""}}},{"id":"a599b1be-8b79-51da-98fb-e104d350d9c3","sort_order":5,"illustration":"multimeter","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_multimeter"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Belgini olib, avtomatni yoqing. Multimetr bilan L–N orasida ~220 V borligini tekshiring. Rozetka qizisa yoki chirsillasa — darhol o'chiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Снимите табличку, включите автомат. Мультиметром проверьте ~220 В между L и N. Если розетка греется или трещит — немедленно отключите.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Remove the sign and switch the breaker on. Check ~220 V between L and N with the multimeter. If the socket heats up or crackles, switch off at once.","warning":""}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"b64ebf47-46a8-a80f-85ca-76f9eb753569","sort_order":0,"correct_index":2,"t":{"uz":{"q":"PE simi bo'lmasa, yerga ulash klemmasini nima qilasiz?","options":["Nolga ulayman","Fazaga ulayman","Bo'sh qoldiraman va elektrik bilan maslahatlashaman"],"explanation":"Klemmani nolga ulash nol uzilganda korpusda kuchlanish paydo bo'lishiga olib keladi."},"ru":{"q":"Если нет провода PE, что делать с клеммой заземления?","options":["Соединить с нулём","Соединить с фазой","Оставить свободной и проконсультироваться с электриком"],"explanation":"Перемычка на ноль при обрыве нуля даёт напряжение на корпусе."},"en":{"q":"With no PE wire, what do you do with the earth terminal?","options":["Connect it to neutral","Connect it to phase","Leave it free and consult an electrician"],"explanation":"Bridging to neutral puts voltage on appliance cases if the neutral breaks."}}},{"id":"c946cef2-98a3-797f-3d52-f941d2b08cd7","sort_order":1,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Rozetka guruhi uchun odatda qaysi kabel ishlatiladi?","options":["Mis 2,5 mm²","Mis 0,75 mm²","Alyuminiy 1 mm²"],"explanation":"Rozetka guruhi — mis 2,5 mm², avtomat 16 A (mahalliy normalar bilan tekshiring)."},"ru":{"q":"Какой кабель обычно для розеточной группы?","options":["Медь 2,5 мм²","Медь 0,75 мм²","Алюминий 1 мм²"],"explanation":"Розеточная группа — медь 2,5 мм², автомат 16 А (сверяйтесь с местными нормами)."},"en":{"q":"Which cable is typical for a socket circuit?","options":["Copper 2.5 mm²","Copper 0.75 mm²","Aluminium 1 mm²"],"explanation":"Socket circuit — copper 2.5 mm², 16 A breaker (check local norms)."}}},{"id":"af43d87f-95d6-45d9-daf5-53b501144137","sort_order":2,"correct_index":1,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Izolyatsiya qancha tozalanadi?","options":["30 mm","Taxminan 10 mm","Umuman tozalanmaydi"],"explanation":"Klemmaga kerakli uzunlik ~10 mm; ortiqcha ochiq mis xavfli."},"ru":{"q":"Сколько изоляции снимать?","options":["30 мм","Около 10 мм","Не снимать"],"explanation":"Для клеммы нужно ~10 мм; лишняя оголённая медь опасна."},"en":{"q":"How much insulation do you strip?","options":["30 mm","About 10 mm","None"],"explanation":"About 10 mm fits the terminal; extra bare copper is dangerous."}}}]},{"id":"ff4e20ad-a3d3-d13a-c2bb-15b5f3b74232","slug":"switch-single","sort_order":5,"difficulty":2,"est_minutes":25,"icon":"switch","t":{"uz":{"title":"Bir klavishli kalit","summary":"Kalit fazani uzadi — nolni emas."},"ru":{"title":"Одноклавишный выключатель","summary":"Выключатель разрывает фазу — не ноль."},"en":{"title":"Single-gang switch","summary":"A switch breaks the phase — never the neutral."}},"steps":[{"id":"296d1ce9-6f9c-c6c3-f191-ca4220ca495b","sort_order":0,"illustration":"breaker_off","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Yoritish avtomatini o'chiring, belgi iling, kuchlanish yo'qligini tekshiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Отключите автомат освещения, повесьте табличку, проверьте отсутствие напряжения.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Switch off the lighting breaker, hang the sign, verify there is no voltage.","warning":""}}},{"id":"26d425bb-4be1-220c-34dd-a90f84d2e0f3","sort_order":1,"illustration":"switch_single","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Sxema: tarqatish qutisidan faza kalitning kirish (L) klemmasiga keladi. Kalitning chiqishidan (L1) sim chiroqqa boradi. Nol qutidan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri chiroqqa boradi.","warning":"Nolni kalit orqali o'tkazmang."},"ru":{"text":"Схема: фаза из распаечной коробки приходит на входную клемму выключателя (L). С выхода (L1) провод идёт на светильник. Ноль идёт из коробки прямо на светильник.","warning":"Не пропускайте ноль через выключатель."},"en":{"text":"Diagram: phase from the junction box goes to the switch input (L). From the output (L1) a wire goes to the lamp. Neutral goes straight from the box to the lamp.","warning":"Never route the neutral through the switch."}}},{"id":"560f6855-cac5-9711-c4c6-01e7744707e8","sort_order":2,"illustration":"switch_single","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_wire_stripper","tool_screwdriver_set"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Simlarni 10 mm tozalab, kalit klemmalariga ulang (vintli yoki prujinali). Simni tortib ko'ring — chiqib ketmasligi kerak.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Зачистите жилы на 10 мм и подключите к клеммам выключателя (винтовым или пружинным). Потяните провод — он не должен выскакивать.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Strip 10 mm and connect to the switch terminals (screw or spring). Tug each wire — it must not come out.","warning":""}}},{"id":"503062b1-3bcf-50cc-259b-70444b62d064","sort_order":3,"illustration":"socket_box","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_screwdriver_set"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Kalitni shunday o'rnatingki, klavishning yuqori qismi bosilganda chiroq yonsin. Mexanizmni podrozetnikka mahkamlang, ramka va klavishni qo'ying.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Установите выключатель так, чтобы свет включался нажатием на верхнюю часть клавиши. Закрепите механизм, установите рамку и клавишу.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Orient the switch so pressing the top of the rocker turns the light on. Fix the mechanism, then fit the frame and rocker.","warning":""}}},{"id":"60abfde0-3a49-5219-6f7f-3ad68e13b761","sort_order":4,"illustration":"voltage_tester","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Avtomatni yoqing va tekshiring. Kalit o'chiq holatda chiroq patronida faza bo'lmasligi kerak (indikator yonmaydi).","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Включите автомат и проверьте. При выключенном выключателе на патроне не должно быть фазы (индикатор не светится).","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Switch the breaker on and test. With the switch off there must be no phase at the lamp holder (indicator stays dark).","warning":""}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"3cbc9121-aff9-98ab-f5cb-5daffd948fda","sort_order":0,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Kalit qaysi simni uzishi kerak?","options":["Fazani (L)","Nolni (N)","PE ni"],"explanation":"Faza uzilsa, o'chiq chiroqda kuchlanish bo'lmaydi."},"ru":{"q":"Какой провод должен разрывать выключатель?","options":["Фазу (L)","Ноль (N)","PE"],"explanation":"При разрыве фазы на выключенном светильнике нет напряжения."},"en":{"q":"Which wire must the switch break?","options":["Phase (L)","Neutral (N)","PE"],"explanation":"Breaking the phase leaves no voltage on a switched-off lamp."}}},{"id":"c9580b0c-68fb-45f1-dc72-426ab6515d04","sort_order":1,"correct_index":1,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Yoritish guruhi uchun odatiy avtomat?","options":["32 A","10 A","63 A"],"explanation":"Mis 1,5 mm² yoritish uchun odatda 10 A avtomat."},"ru":{"q":"Типичный автомат для группы освещения?","options":["32 А","10 А","63 А"],"explanation":"Для меди 1,5 мм² на освещение обычно автомат 10 А."},"en":{"q":"Typical breaker for a lighting circuit?","options":["32 A","10 A","63 A"],"explanation":"For copper 1.5 mm² lighting, typically a 10 A breaker."}}}]},{"id":"98aab9c6-8092-3cfc-81a2-987aca7c2673","slug":"switch-double","sort_order":6,"difficulty":2,"est_minutes":30,"icon":"switch2","t":{"uz":{"title":"Ikki klavishli kalit","summary":"Ikki chiroq guruhini alohida boshqarish."},"ru":{"title":"Двухклавишный выключатель","summary":"Раздельное управление двумя группами ламп."},"en":{"title":"Double-gang switch","summary":"Controlling two groups of lights separately."}},"steps":[{"id":"8cf2ecf0-ce7d-b861-0abc-45727e37ccf0","sort_order":0,"illustration":"breaker_off","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Yoritish avtomatini o'chiring, belgi iling, kuchlanish yo'qligini tekshiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Отключите автомат освещения, повесьте табличку, проверьте отсутствие напряжения.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Switch off the lighting breaker, hang the sign, verify there is no voltage.","warning":""}}},{"id":"794a220e-be77-59f3-de17-e79b0ce65cac","sort_order":1,"illustration":"switch_double","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Kalitning bitta umumiy kirishi (L) va ikkita chiqishi (L1, L2) bor. Kalitga 3 tomirli kabel keladi: faza va ikki chiqish. Chiroqqa ham 3 tomirli kabel: L1, L2, N (+PE bo'lsa 4 tomir).","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"У выключателя один общий вход (L) и два выхода (L1, L2). К выключателю идёт 3-жильный кабель: фаза и два выхода. К люстре тоже 3 жилы: L1, L2, N (+PE — 4 жилы).","warning":""},"en":{"text":"The switch has one common input (L) and two outputs (L1, L2). A 3-core cable runs to the switch: phase plus two outputs. The fixture also gets 3 cores: L1, L2, N (+PE makes 4).","warning":""}}},{"id":"dcf14f8a-e282-3ddf-5bd9-5a3452ded1c3","sort_order":2,"illustration":"switch_double","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_wire_stripper","tool_screwdriver_set"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Fazani L klemmaga, chiqish simlarini L1 va L2 ga ulang. Qutida L1 va L2 ni chiroqning ikki guruhiga, nolni chiroqning N ga WAGO tipidagi klemmalar bilan ulang.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Фазу подключите к клемме L, выходы — к L1 и L2. В коробке соедините L1 и L2 с двумя группами люстры, ноль — с N люстры клеммами типа WAGO.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Connect phase to L, the outputs to L1 and L2. In the junction box join L1 and L2 to the two lamp groups and neutral to the fixture's N using WAGO-type connectors.","warning":""}}},{"id":"b3222957-c49f-a3f8-c42f-5d28db6f2ccc","sort_order":3,"illustration":"socket_box","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_screwdriver_set"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Mexanizmni podrozetnikka mahkamlang, ramka va klavishlarni o'rnating.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Закрепите механизм в подрозетнике, установите рамку и клавиши.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Fix the mechanism in the wall box, fit the frame and rockers.","warning":""}}},{"id":"e24b3e62-df0f-cca7-fea3-d2a3b6a0b96d","sort_order":4,"illustration":"voltage_tester","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Yoqing va har ikkala klavishni alohida tekshiring. Har bir klavish faqat o'z guruhini yoqishi kerak.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Включите и проверьте каждую клавишу отдельно. Каждая клавиша должна включать только свою группу.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Power up and test each rocker separately. Each must switch only its own group.","warning":""}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"5e18e071-d128-06ce-08eb-b26d6e93ae53","sort_order":0,"correct_index":1,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Ikki klavishli kalitga necha tomirli kabel keladi (PE siz)?","options":["2","3","5"],"explanation":"Faza + ikkita chiqish = 3 tomir."},"ru":{"q":"Сколько жил кабеля идёт к двухклавишному выключателю (без PE)?","options":["2","3","5"],"explanation":"Фаза + два выхода = 3 жилы."},"en":{"q":"How many cores go to a double-gang switch (without PE)?","options":["2","3","5"],"explanation":"Phase + two outputs = 3 cores."}}},{"id":"480e5bb8-bb9f-5b82-a6c8-42f4e11c164e","sort_order":1,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Qutida simlar qanday ulanadi?","options":["WAGO tipidagi klemmalar bilan","Faqat buralib, lenta bilan","Skotch bilan"],"explanation":"Buralgan ulanish vaqt o'tib qiziydi; klemmalar ishonchli."},"ru":{"q":"Как соединять провода в коробке?","options":["Клеммами типа WAGO","Просто скруткой с изолентой","Скотчем"],"explanation":"Скрутка со временем греется; клеммы надёжнее."},"en":{"q":"How are wires joined in the box?","options":["With WAGO-type connectors","Just twisted and taped","With sticky tape"],"explanation":"Twisted joints heat up over time; connectors are reliable."}}}]},{"id":"98ff0810-20d1-0fae-015a-5a8358285eb1","slug":"switch-pass-through","sort_order":7,"difficulty":3,"est_minutes":45,"icon":"switch_pass","t":{"uz":{"title":"O'tish (proxodnoy) kaliti","summary":"Bitta chiroqni ikki joydan boshqarish."},"ru":{"title":"Проходной выключатель","summary":"Управление одной лампой из двух мест."},"en":{"title":"Two-way (pass-through) switch","summary":"Controlling one light from two places."}},"steps":[{"id":"bf45b341-c239-ec32-033c-2b10f5f6b146","sort_order":0,"illustration":"breaker_off","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Yoritish avtomatini o'chiring, belgi iling, kuchlanish yo'qligini tekshiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Отключите автомат освещения, повесьте табличку, проверьте отсутствие напряжения.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Switch off the lighting breaker, hang the sign, verify there is no voltage.","warning":""}}},{"id":"b344bb27-c29c-4ad0-cad0-04881a272c37","sort_order":1,"illustration":"switch_pass","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Har bir o'tish kalitida umumiy klemma (COM) va ikkita chiqish (L1, L2) bor. Har ikkala kalitga 3 tomirli kabel keladi.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"У каждого проходного выключателя есть общая клемма (COM) и два выхода (L1, L2). К каждому выключателю идёт 3-жильный кабель.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Each two-way switch has a common terminal (COM) and two outputs (L1, L2). A 3-core cable runs to each switch.","warning":""}}},{"id":"97b68d90-81b1-7212-cb4e-3c9a55e9cc0d","sort_order":2,"illustration":"switch_pass","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Qutida: faza → 1-kalitning COM. 1-kalitning L1 → 2-kalitning L1, L2 → L2 (bu \"o'tish\" simlari). 2-kalitning COM → chiroq. Nol → to'g'ridan-to'g'ri chiroqqa.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"В коробке: фаза → COM первого выключателя. L1 первого → L1 второго, L2 → L2 (это «перемычки»). COM второго → светильник. Ноль → прямо на светильник.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"In the box: phase → COM of switch 1. L1 of switch 1 → L1 of switch 2, L2 → L2 (the travellers). COM of switch 2 → lamp. Neutral → straight to the lamp.","warning":""}}},{"id":"0d6bca1e-2ef4-9673-9e0a-f8de80bcc5e6","sort_order":3,"illustration":"junction_box","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_wire_stripper"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Simlarni chalkashtirmaslik uchun har birini marker yoki rangli lenta bilan belgilang (COM, L1, L2). Ulanishlarni WAGO tipidagi klemmalar bilan bajaring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Чтобы не перепутать, промаркируйте каждую жилу (COM, L1, L2) маркером или цветной изолентой. Соединения — клеммами типа WAGO.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Label every core (COM, L1, L2) with a marker or coloured tape so you don't mix them up. Make joints with WAGO-type connectors.","warning":""}}},{"id":"ddd10492-77e3-85a6-8693-34fe44ee6298","sort_order":4,"illustration":"socket_box","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_screwdriver_set"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Ikkala kalitni podrozetniklarga mahkamlang.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Закрепите оба выключателя в подрозетниках.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Fix both switches in their wall boxes.","warning":""}}},{"id":"a93bd77f-f4a7-1758-b684-7bbc8f9ea94c","sort_order":5,"illustration":"voltage_tester","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Yoqing va tekshiring: har ikkala kalitning istalgan holatida ikkinchisi chiroqni yoqib-o'chira olishi kerak. Ishlamasa — avtomatni o'chirib, COM simini qayta tekshiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Включите и проверьте: в любом положении одного выключателя второй должен включать и выключать свет. Не работает — отключите автомат и проверьте провод COM.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Power up and test: in any position of one switch, the other must turn the light on and off. If not, switch off the breaker and recheck the COM wire.","warning":""}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"0932d65d-d9bb-fb26-90f5-9b6bb5440dc3","sort_order":0,"correct_index":2,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Faza 1-kalitning qaysi klemmasiga ulanadi?","options":["L1","L2","COM"],"explanation":"Faza umumiy klemma COM ga keladi."},"ru":{"q":"К какой клемме первого выключателя подключается фаза?","options":["L1","L2","COM"],"explanation":"Фаза приходит на общую клемму COM."},"en":{"q":"Which terminal of switch 1 gets the phase?","options":["L1","L2","COM"],"explanation":"Phase goes to the common terminal COM."}}},{"id":"7470799a-5254-b56f-45b2-dd15200f9e7b","sort_order":1,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Ikki kalit orasida nechta \"o'tish\" simi bor?","options":["2","1","4"],"explanation":"L1–L1 va L2–L2 — ikkita o'tish simi."},"ru":{"q":"Сколько перемычек между двумя выключателями?","options":["2","1","4"],"explanation":"L1–L1 и L2–L2 — две перемычки."},"en":{"q":"How many travellers run between the two switches?","options":["2","1","4"],"explanation":"L1–L1 and L2–L2 — two travellers."}}}]},{"id":"b9d147f8-ed58-cf52-687d-f262923e2cca","slug":"lamp-install","sort_order":8,"difficulty":2,"est_minutes":40,"icon":"lamp","t":{"uz":{"title":"Chiroq (svetilnik) o'rnatish","summary":"Shiftga yoki devorga chiroqni xavfsiz osish va ulash."},"ru":{"title":"Установка светильника","summary":"Безопасный монтаж и подключение светильника на потолок или стену."},"en":{"title":"Installing a light fixture","summary":"Mounting and connecting a ceiling or wall light safely."}},"steps":[{"id":"6eb20fb7-0704-cc84-464b-6ecde8d6e9f3","sort_order":0,"illustration":"breaker_off","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Yoritish avtomatini o'chiring (faqat kalitni emas!), belgi iling, shiftdagi simlarda kuchlanish yo'qligini tekshiring.","warning":"Faqat kalitni o'chirish yetarli emas — kalit nolni uzgan bo'lishi mumkin."},"ru":{"text":"Отключите автомат освещения (не только выключатель!), повесьте табличку, проверьте отсутствие напряжения на проводах в потолке.","warning":"Выключателя недостаточно — он мог быть подключён в разрыв нуля."},"en":{"text":"Switch off the lighting breaker (not just the wall switch!), hang the sign, verify there is no voltage on the ceiling wires.","warning":"The wall switch alone is not enough — it may have been wired on the neutral."}}},{"id":"8cc20063-dbf7-ddee-fa27-bc3cc608b4da","sort_order":1,"illustration":"lamp","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_drill"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Chiroq og'irligiga mos mahkamlagich (planka yoki ilmoq) o'rnating. Og'ir qandil uchun anker ishlating. Ikkinchi odam yordam bersin.","warning":"Burg'ilashdan oldin devor/shiftda sim yo'qligini detektor bilan tekshiring."},"ru":{"text":"Установите крепление (планку или крюк) под вес светильника. Для тяжёлой люстры — анкер. Работайте вдвоём.","warning":"Перед сверлением проверьте детектором, что в этом месте нет проводки."},"en":{"text":"Fit a mount (bracket or hook) rated for the fixture weight. Use an anchor for a heavy chandelier. Work with a helper.","warning":"Before drilling, check with a detector that there are no wires there."}}},{"id":"7a106306-0b94-d702-afc4-b3b97c36a6a4","sort_order":2,"illustration":"lamp_wiring","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_wire_stripper"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Chiroq simlarini WAGO tipidagi klemmalar bilan ulang: kalitdan kelgan faza → chiroqning L, nol → N, PE (bo'lsa) → chiroq korpusidagi yerga ulash. Patron bo'lsa: faza markaziy kontaktga.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Подключите провода светильника клеммами типа WAGO: фаза с выключателя → L светильника, ноль → N, PE (если есть) → клемма заземления корпуса. В патроне фаза — на центральный контакт.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Connect with WAGO-type connectors: switched phase → fixture L, neutral → N, PE (if present) → the fixture's earth terminal. In a lamp holder the phase goes to the centre contact.","warning":""}}},{"id":"3421129a-543d-07ae-97dd-71ba9fda6652","sort_order":3,"illustration":"lamp","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_screwdriver_set"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Klemmalarni chiroq qopqog'i ichiga joylang, simlar qisilib qolmasin. Chiroqni mahkamlagichga burab qo'ying.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Уберите клеммы под декоративный стакан, чтобы провода не пережались. Закрепите светильник на креплении.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Tuck the connectors under the canopy without pinching the wires. Fix the fixture to its mount.","warning":""}}},{"id":"e36a0b88-29f6-e3fd-8ab6-8c25a7b87715","sort_order":4,"illustration":"voltage_tester","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Lampochkalarni o'rnating (quvvati ruxsat etilgandan oshmasin), avtomatni yoqing va tekshiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Вкрутите лампы (не мощнее допустимого), включите автомат и проверьте.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Fit bulbs (not above the rated wattage), switch the breaker on and test.","warning":""}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"c16dbaa1-2d62-d82d-289f-449786916d07","sort_order":0,"correct_index":1,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Chiroq o'rnatishda nimani o'chirish kerak?","options":["Faqat devor kalitini","Yoritish avtomatini","Hech narsani"],"explanation":"Kalit nolni uzgan bo'lishi mumkin, shuning uchun avtomatni o'chiring."},"ru":{"q":"Что нужно отключить при установке светильника?","options":["Только выключатель","Автомат освещения","Ничего"],"explanation":"Выключатель мог разрывать ноль, поэтому отключайте автомат."},"en":{"q":"What must you switch off to install a fixture?","options":["Only the wall switch","The lighting breaker","Nothing"],"explanation":"The switch may break the neutral, so switch off the breaker."}}},{"id":"e828b719-01db-2616-b686-972480ed1e49","sort_order":1,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"E27 patronida faza qayerga ulanadi?","options":["Markaziy kontaktga","Rezbali qismga","Farqi yo'q"],"explanation":"Rezbali qismga tegish ehtimoli bor — u nolda bo'lishi kerak."},"ru":{"q":"Куда подключается фаза в патроне E27?","options":["На центральный контакт","На резьбу","Неважно"],"explanation":"Резьбы можно коснуться — на ней должен быть ноль."},"en":{"q":"Where does the phase go in an E27 holder?","options":["Centre contact","Screw thread","It does not matter"],"explanation":"The thread can be touched — it must carry the neutral."}}}]},{"id":"b0b9de0c-cc10-1476-fc67-fb6d0c50ce27","slug":"junction-box","sort_order":9,"difficulty":2,"est_minutes":30,"icon":"junction","t":{"uz":{"title":"Tarqatish qutisida ulash","summary":"Simlarni qutida tartibli va ishonchli ulash."},"ru":{"title":"Соединения в распаечной коробке","summary":"Аккуратные и надёжные соединения в коробке."},"en":{"title":"Junction box connections","summary":"Tidy, reliable joints inside a junction box."}},"steps":[{"id":"76e062d7-2f9f-9a3e-de27-dace64cbb40e","sort_order":0,"illustration":"breaker_off","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_voltage_tester"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Xonaning barcha guruh avtomatlarini o'chiring, belgi iling, qutidagi har bir simda kuchlanish yo'qligini tekshiring.","warning":"Qutiga bir nechta guruh kelishi mumkin — hammasini tekshiring."},"ru":{"text":"Отключите автоматы всех групп комнаты, повесьте табличку, проверьте отсутствие напряжения на каждом проводе в коробке.","warning":"В коробку может приходить несколько групп — проверьте все."},"en":{"text":"Switch off all breakers feeding the room, hang the sign, verify no voltage on every wire in the box.","warning":"Several circuits may enter one box — check them all."}}},{"id":"b1fd3c46-e0af-54e3-62b3-c9b416ee4209","sort_order":1,"illustration":"junction_box","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Qutini shiftdan 15–20 sm pastda, oson ochiladigan joyda o'rnating. Quti ustini suvoq bilan butunlay yopmang — unga keyin ham kirish kerak bo'ladi.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Устанавливайте коробку на 15–20 см ниже потолка, в доступном месте. Не замуровывайте коробку — к ней нужен доступ.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Mount the box 15–20 cm below the ceiling in an accessible place. Never plaster over it — it must stay accessible.","warning":""}}},{"id":"f7458816-d427-de27-c6f7-bd73a6a11492","sort_order":2,"illustration":"junction_box","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_wire_stripper"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Har bir kabel uchini qutiga 10–15 sm zapas bilan kiriting. Tomirlarni rangi bo'yicha guruhlang: barcha nollar (ko'k), barcha PE (sariq-yashil), fazalar alohida.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Заведите кабели в коробку с запасом 10–15 см. Сгруппируйте жилы по цвету: все нули (синие), все PE (жёлто-зелёные), фазы отдельно.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Bring each cable into the box with 10–15 cm slack. Group the cores by colour: all neutrals (blue), all PE (yellow-green), phases separately.","warning":""}}},{"id":"c86d541e-3590-cf12-492b-c977f3731c62","sort_order":3,"illustration":"wago","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"WAGO tipidagi klemmalardan foydalaning: izolyatsiyani klemmadagi belgi bo'yicha (odatda 11 mm) tozalang, simni oxirigacha kiriting, richagni yoping. Simni tortib tekshiring.","warning":"Mis va alyuminiy simni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ulash taqiqlanadi."},"ru":{"text":"Используйте клеммы типа WAGO: зачистите изоляцию по метке на клемме (обычно 11 мм), вставьте жилу до упора, закройте рычажок. Проверьте, потянув провод.","warning":"Прямое соединение меди с алюминием запрещено."},"en":{"text":"Use WAGO-type lever connectors: strip to the gauge on the connector (usually 11 mm), push the core fully in, close the lever. Tug to check.","warning":"Never join copper directly to aluminium."}}},{"id":"c065a033-4ce9-0128-c436-950b13572990","sort_order":4,"illustration":"junction_box","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Klemmalar soni guruhlar soniga mos bo'lsin; bitta klemmaga uning ruxsat etilgan simlar sonidan ko'p sim kiritmang. Qopqoqni yoping.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Не вставляйте в одну клемму больше жил, чем она рассчитана. Закройте крышку коробки.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Do not put more conductors into a connector than it is rated for. Close the box lid.","warning":""}}},{"id":"06d73e0c-6565-4467-1d8f-3a790702ae00","sort_order":5,"illustration":"multimeter","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_multimeter"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Belgini olib, avtomatlarni yoqing va har bir rozetka, kalit va chiroqni tekshiring.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Снимите табличку, включите автоматы и проверьте каждую розетку, выключатель и светильник.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Remove the sign, switch the breakers on and test every socket, switch and light.","warning":""}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"fdb9767f-ab4d-12b4-8c1f-67b84fd487cc","sort_order":0,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Tarqatish qutisini suvoq bilan yopish mumkinmi?","options":["Yo'q, unga kirish bo'lishi kerak","Ha","Faqat oshxonada"],"explanation":"Quti xizmat ko'rsatish uchun ochiq bo'lishi kerak."},"ru":{"q":"Можно ли замуровать распаечную коробку?","options":["Нет, к ней нужен доступ","Да","Только на кухне"],"explanation":"Коробка должна оставаться доступной для обслуживания."},"en":{"q":"May you plaster over a junction box?","options":["No, it must stay accessible","Yes","Only in kitchens"],"explanation":"The box must remain accessible for maintenance."}}},{"id":"dd9f0a93-7561-48f1-4b02-8cd220cf9d94","sort_order":1,"correct_index":2,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Mis va alyuminiy simni qanday ulaysiz?","options":["Burab","Lenta bilan","DIY qilmayman — elektrik chaqiraman"],"explanation":"Eski alyuminiy simlar — elektrik ishi."},"ru":{"q":"Как соединить медь с алюминием?","options":["Скруткой","Изолентой","Не делаю сам — вызываю электрика"],"explanation":"Старая алюминиевая проводка — работа для электрика."},"en":{"q":"How do you join copper to aluminium?","options":["Twist them","Tape them","Not DIY — call an electrician"],"explanation":"Old aluminium wiring is an electrician's job."}}}]},{"id":"7ef352b1-bd86-9671-c711-b90b162d0d11","slug":"cable-routing","sort_order":10,"difficulty":3,"est_minutes":60,"icon":"route","t":{"uz":{"title":"Kabel trassasi va devorni shtrobalash","summary":"Kabelni to'g'ri yo'naltirish va devorga yotqizish."},"ru":{"title":"Трасса кабеля и штробление стен","summary":"Правильная прокладка кабеля и штробление."},"en":{"title":"Cable routing and wall chasing","summary":"Routing cable correctly and cutting wall chases."}},"steps":[{"id":"eb8e945c-fd55-161c-27cc-4b40efb8302c","sort_order":0,"illustration":"cable_route","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Kabel faqat vertikal va gorizontal yo'naladi. Gorizontal trassa shiftdan 15 sm pastda, vertikal trassa burchakdan, eshik va derazadan kamida 10–15 sm uzoqda.","warning":"Diagonal yotqizish taqiqlanadi — keyin mixlaganda kabelga tegib ketasiz."},"ru":{"text":"Кабель прокладывается только вертикально и горизонтально. Горизонталь — на 15 см ниже потолка, вертикаль — не ближе 10–15 см от углов, дверей и окон.","warning":"Диагональная прокладка запрещена — потом легко попасть в кабель."},"en":{"text":"Cable runs only vertically and horizontally. Horizontal runs 15 cm below the ceiling; vertical runs at least 10–15 cm from corners, doors and windows.","warning":"No diagonal runs — you would hit the cable when drilling later."}}},{"id":"b7ef911d-6929-f010-64b5-3f793ef47d5d","sort_order":1,"illustration":"cable_route","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_pencil_level"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Devorga qalam va daraja (uroven) bilan trassani chizing. Rozetkalar polidan 30 sm, kalitlar 90–100 sm balandlikda. Trassani telefon bilan suratga oling — keyin kerak bo'ladi.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Разметьте трассу на стене карандашом и уровнем. Розетки — 30 см от пола, выключатели — 90–100 см. Сфотографируйте разметку — пригодится.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Mark the route on the wall with a pencil and level. Sockets 30 cm from the floor, switches at 90–100 cm. Photograph the marks — you will need them later.","warning":""}}},{"id":"ee6c1e62-aace-1234-451b-2523386fedd2","sort_order":2,"illustration":"wall_chase","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_cable_detector"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Shtrobalashdan oldin detektor bilan eski simlar va quvurlarni qidiring. Panelli uylarda yuk ko'taruvchi devorlarni shtrobalash taqiqlanadi — ochiq kabel kanalidan foydalaning.","warning":"Yuk ko'taruvchi devorni gorizontal shtrobalamang."},"ru":{"text":"Перед штроблением найдите детектором старую проводку и трубы. В панельных домах штробить несущие стены запрещено — используйте открытый кабель-канал.","warning":"Не штробите несущие стены горизонтально."},"en":{"text":"Before chasing, scan for old wires and pipes with a detector. In panel buildings chasing load-bearing walls is forbidden — use surface cable trunking instead.","warning":"Never chase load-bearing walls horizontally."}}},{"id":"6100c0fb-0586-c708-d1e5-2b8d7c9abb29","sort_order":3,"illustration":"wall_chase","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_wall_chaser","tool_drill"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Shtroba chuqurligi ~20–25 mm, kengligi kabel yoki gofra quvurdan biroz katta. Changga qarshi niqob, ko'zoynak va quloqchin taqing. Podrozetniklar uchun 68 mm toj ishlating.","warning":"Shtrobalash paytida ishchi xonadagi barcha guruhlar o'chirilgan bo'lsin."},"ru":{"text":"Глубина штробы ~20–25 мм, ширина — чуть больше кабеля или гофры. Наденьте респиратор, очки и наушники. Под подрозетники — коронка 68 мм.","warning":"Во время штробления все группы в комнате должны быть отключены."},"en":{"text":"Chase depth ~20–25 mm, width a little more than the cable or conduit. Wear a dust mask, goggles and ear protection. Use a 68 mm hole saw for wall boxes.","warning":"Keep all circuits in the room switched off while chasing."}}},{"id":"0d28a6b3-bc7a-9eca-bda1-cb5ff0145ace","sort_order":4,"illustration":"cable_route","image_path":null,"tools":[],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Kabelni tortmasdan, zapas bilan yotqizing va klipslar bilan har 40–50 sm da mahkamlang. Gipsokarton va yog'och devorlarda — faqat yonmaydigan gofra quvurda. Kabelni tutashtirmang — ulanishlar faqat qutida.","warning":"Yog'och devorlarda yashirin yotqizish — elektrik bilan maslahatlashing."},"ru":{"text":"Укладывайте кабель без натяга, с запасом, крепите клипсами каждые 40–50 см. В гипсокартоне и дереве — только в негорючей гофре. Не сращивайте кабель в стене — соединения только в коробке.","warning":"Скрытая проводка в деревянных стенах — проконсультируйтесь с электриком."},"en":{"text":"Lay the cable without tension, with slack, clipped every 40–50 cm. In plasterboard and wood use only non-flammable conduit. Never splice inside the wall — joints only in boxes.","warning":"Concealed wiring in wooden walls — consult an electrician."}}},{"id":"d5b2f5ab-3c8f-a4b0-88db-de8a8ed20c88","sort_order":5,"illustration":"multimeter","image_path":null,"tools":["tool_multimeter"],"t":{"uz":{"text":"Shtrobani yopishdan oldin multimetr bilan har bir kabelning butunligini (prozvonka) tekshiring va trassani suratga oling. Keyin alebastr bilan yoping.","warning":""},"ru":{"text":"Перед заделкой штробы прозвоните каждый кабель мультиметром и сфотографируйте трассу. Затем заделайте алебастром.","warning":""},"en":{"text":"Before filling the chase, continuity-test every cable with a multimeter and photograph the route. Then fill with gypsum plaster.","warning":""}}}],"quiz":[{"id":"fd3aa813-dfa4-ca9e-67a0-97f305ff18b7","sort_order":0,"correct_index":1,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Gorizontal trassa qayerdan o'tadi?","options":["Devor o'rtasidan","Shiftdan ~15 sm pastdan","Diagonal"],"explanation":"Standart joy — kabel qayerdaligini oldindan bilish mumkin."},"ru":{"q":"Где проходит горизонтальная трасса?","options":["Посередине стены","~15 см ниже потолка","По диагонали"],"explanation":"Стандартное место — всегда известно, где кабель."},"en":{"q":"Where does a horizontal run go?","options":["Mid-wall","~15 cm below the ceiling","Diagonally"],"explanation":"A standard place means you always know where the cable is."}}},{"id":"0347b285-65bf-8123-1a70-bbc710b402c0","sort_order":1,"correct_index":0,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Kabelni devor ichida ulash mumkinmi?","options":["Yo'q, faqat qutida","Ha, lenta bilan","Ha, buralib"],"explanation":"Devordagi ulanish ko'rinmaydi va qizib ketishi mumkin."},"ru":{"q":"Можно ли сращивать кабель внутри стены?","options":["Нет, только в коробке","Да, изолентой","Да, скруткой"],"explanation":"Соединение в стене недоступно и может перегреться."},"en":{"q":"May you join cable inside the wall?","options":["No, only in a box","Yes, with tape","Yes, twisted"],"explanation":"A joint in the wall is inaccessible and may overheat."}}},{"id":"093d02be-1c26-08e5-0840-d01ea6169e7b","sort_order":2,"correct_index":2,"t":{"uz":{"q":"Gipsokarton devorda kabel qanday yotqiziladi?","options":["To'g'ridan-to'g'ri","Plastik lentada","Yonmaydigan gofra quvurda"],"explanation":"Gipsokarton ichida kabel himoyalangan bo'lishi kerak."},"ru":{"q":"Как прокладывать кабель в гипсокартоне?","options":["Просто так","В пластиковой ленте","В негорючей гофре"],"explanation":"Внутри гипсокартона кабель должен быть защищён."},"en":{"q":"How do you run cable in plasterboard walls?","options":["Bare","In plastic tape","In non-flammable conduit"],"explanation":"Inside plasterboard the cable must be protected."}}}]}]$ew$::jsonb);

on conflict (key) do nothing;


1. ElektrUy — ta''limiy ilova. U litsenziyali elektrik ishi, loyihasi yoki tekshiruvi o''rnini bosmaydi.

2. Hisob-kitoblar (kabel kesimi, avtomat, uzunlik, materiallar) taxminiy tavsiyalardir. Ularni mahalliy normalar (ShNK/KMK, PUE) bilan tekshiring.

3. Hech qachon kuchlanish ostida ishlamang. Har bir ishdan oldin avtomatni o''chiring, kuchlanish yo''qligini tester bilan tekshiring, "Yoqmang" belgisini osing va izolyatsiyalangan asboblardan foydalaning.

4. Shchit ichidagi ishlar, yerga ulash tizimi, 3 fazali tarmoq, ho''l zonalar, alyuminiy simlar va 3,5 kW dan kuchli qurilmalar — faqat litsenziyali elektrik uchun.

5. Sun''iy intellekt (AI) natijalari taxminiy va xato bo''lishi mumkin. AI tekshiruvi rasmiy ekspertiza emas.

6. Ishni bajarganingizdan so''ng elektrikka ko''rsating. Ishingiz va uning oqibatlari uchun o''zingiz javobgarsiz.

Davom etish orqali siz ushbu shartlarni o''qiganingiz va qabul qilganingizni tasdiqlaysiz.', true),
  ('disclaimer', 1, 'ru', 'БЕЗОПАСНОСТЬ И ОТКАЗ ОТ ОТВЕТСТВЕННОСТИ

1. ElektrUy — образовательное приложение. Оно не заменяет работу, проект или проверку лицензированного электрика.

2. Расчёты (сечение кабеля, автомат, длины, материалы) — приблизительные рекомендации. Сверяйте их с местными нормами (ШНК/КМК, ПУЭ).

3. Никогда не работайте под напряжением. Перед каждой работой отключайте автомат, проверяйте отсутствие напряжения тестером, вешайте табличку «Не включать» и используйте изолированный инструмент.

4. Работы в щите, система заземления, трёхфазная сеть, влажные зоны, алюминиевая проводка и приборы мощнее 3,5 кВт — только для лицензированного электрика.

5. Результаты искусственного интеллекта (ИИ) приблизительны и могут быть ошибочными. Проверка ИИ — не официальная экспертиза.

6. После выполнения работы покажите её электрику. Вы несёте ответственность за свою работу и её последствия.

Продолжая, вы подтверждаете, что прочитали и принимаете эти условия.', true),
  ('disclaimer', 1, 'en', 'SAFETY AND DISCLAIMER

1. ElektrUy is an educational app. It does not replace the work, design or inspection of a licensed electrician.

2. Calculations (cable size, breaker, lengths, materials) are approximate recommendations. Verify them against local norms (ShNK/KMK, PUE).

3. Never work on live circuits. Before every job switch off the breaker, verify absence of voltage with a tester, hang a "Do not switch on" sign and use insulated tools.

4. Distribution board work, earthing systems, three-phase supply, wet zones, aluminium wiring and appliances above 3.5 kW are for a licensed electrician only.

5. Artificial intelligence (AI) results are approximate and can be wrong. An AI check is not a certified inspection.

6. Have an electrician inspect your finished work. You are responsible for your work and its consequences.

By continuing you confirm you have read and accept these terms.', true),
  ('privacy', 1, 'uz', 'MAXFIYLIK SIYOSATI

• Biz Google hisobingizdan ism, email va rasmni kirish uchun olamiz.
• Xona rasmlari va ish rasmlari shaxsiy saqlanadi; ularni faqat siz ko''rasiz. Administrator faqat xato haqida xabar berilgan AI natijalarini ko''rib chiqishi mumkin.
• AI tahlili uchun rasm Anthropic Claude API ga yuboriladi va javob olingach saqlanmaydi.
• Sozlamalar → "Hisobni o''chirish" orqali barcha ma''lumotlaringiz va rasmlaringizni o''chirishingiz mumkin.
• Ma''lumotlar uchinchi shaxslarga sotilmaydi.', true),
  ('privacy', 1, 'ru', 'ПОЛИТИКА КОНФИДЕНЦИАЛЬНОСТИ

• Для входа мы получаем из Google-аккаунта имя, email и фото.
• Фото комнат и работ хранятся приватно; их видите только вы. Администратор может просматривать результаты ИИ-проверок, отмеченные как ошибочные.
• Для анализа ИИ фото отправляется в Anthropic Claude API и не сохраняется там после ответа.
• В Настройки → «Удалить аккаунт» можно удалить все ваши данные и фото.
• Данные не продаются третьим лицам.', true),
  ('privacy', 1, 'en', 'PRIVACY POLICY

• To sign in we receive your name, email and photo from your Google account.
• Room and work photos are stored privately; only you can see them. Admins may review AI check results that were flagged as wrong.
• For AI analysis a photo is sent to the Anthropic Claude API and is not retained there after the response.
• Settings → "Delete account" removes all your data and photos.
• Your data is never sold to third parties.', true)
on conflict (kind, version, lang) do nothing;
